{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9c70cea0a1b871a1a8be6e1fb46caf476e5c1b0e5bbdcd123d4431bb7ab97834", "ja": "（ひなたの『アイグラ！！』の撮影が一段落し、\n休憩所になっている教室へと移動しているのだが……）", "zh": "（日向的《I‧G‧R‧A！！》拍摄工作告一段落，\n她在往休息用教室移动的途中……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "32a1fd5c375f8226513c09534cc5c3c3ead3c80717ddf1cd8ab275f7e485319a", "ja": "わぁ……。\nここの靴箱も、おんなしなんだねぇ……。", "zh": "哇……\n这里的鞋柜也是一样的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "852237aae4678b104b444208141f38390f426f028477f8431af9b5faacf40356", "ja": "ひなた、靴箱がどうかしたのか？", "zh": "日向，鞋柜怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "322bb9f1c1b75518c15b4a7ec1bdddefcec7921ffe67b7d4b2f3e5aa0bbe1a25", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……えへへ。\nあのね、ちょっこし思い出してんだわぁ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……嘿嘿。\n那个呀，我想起了一些往事哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "9952df012c1c9cdecce94bdef14320c30ab5b1b69b6f77036538bcd52fdfa15c", "ja": "アイドルになるために東京に出てきて、\nこっちの学校に転校してきた、最初の日のこと。", "zh": "就是我为了成为偶像来到东京，\n转学过来第一天发生的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d08da972187464446593a83629fcd5a9e418a4ab3b8904180f7415dabe8e10fd", "ja": "そうか。\n転校の時は、ご両親が来てくれたんだったな？", "zh": "这样啊。\n转学的时候，你父母有来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "e2410d7a0d33c28b599f71e185b7bb7a692c5b4e390ee9e80cfd9a0e37b35cca", "ja": "うん。転校する時は、父ちゃんと\n母ちゃんが一緒に来てくれたんだけども……。", "zh": "嗯，转学的时候，\n爸爸和妈妈有一起过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "84e5983912281b336ef596cb4acaccdd93a04544ee772a0cb85edf4c93087690", "ja": "初めて学校に来た日は、やっぱし不安でねえ。\nでも……。", "zh": "但第一次上学的那天我还是很不安，\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "b1dec5acef1dc732cc7383659b9df84cb9ae21fbdaa8ed9edba13f730048b226", "ja": "こうして靴箱を見たら、同じだって思ったんだわ。\nあたしが北海道で通ってた学校も、こういう靴箱でね。", "zh": "当我看到鞋柜，我就觉得没有差异了。\n我在北海道上的学校也是使用这种鞋柜哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "840c5a86ab2ef8ff008accd5020a8b0c843a0b798dbd1e6da1b400c95de4d8da", "ja": "{$P$}。北海道の子も、東京の子も、\nみんなおんなしように、学校に通ってるんだねぇ。", "zh": "{$P$}，北海道的学生和东京的学生，\n大家上学的方式都是相同的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2f7bd5287e9254cce7780a4f4742295544f4d308211df1a55c9dde30b5b975a5", "ja": "うん、そうだな。学校って場所は、\n北海道でも東京でも、同じなのかもしれないな。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。学校这种地方，\n不管是北海道或东京，可能都是一样的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "319864a2136c1be1fe16319f16b22c4f22b34bc853badf252027a3f5dbedca0c", "ja": "そうだねぇ。\n東京は街だけじゃなく、学校も人も多いけども……。", "zh": "就是说呢～\n东京不只是街道，连学校和人口都很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "e8db6a4ba93e0dd909e9cfb48ec39e3270e49d6ff24b70121206c031c64157b7", "ja": "ひとクラスの人数は、そんなに多くないかも\nしれないねぇ。あたしの学校だけなんだろか？", "zh": "但一个班级的人数好像不多呢～\n只有我的学校是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1013_p", "source_sha256": "16e1c086c7a6519bb0f3687179c731c9c1ab67db0190e5beb85ad9ae767dec66", "ja": "言われてみれば、東京は子どもの数が少ないかな。\n……寂しいか？　ひなた。", "zh": "这么一说，可能是东京的儿童人口比较少吧。\n……日向，你会觉得寂寞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "75b6434acaf83750123b4c7eaf44e0ff83831cb2a57d7d5c2d8cd926b48fc243", "ja": "ううん、大丈夫。あたしには\n学校の友達の他に、劇場のみんながいるべさ。", "zh": "不，我不会。\n我除了学校的朋友，还有剧场的大家哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "606338462d7d4055a5cd5831cfbdf27339760d1f773d66699780bc18b6ce4cb5", "ja": "それに、{$P$}や美咲さん、\n小鳥さんに社長さんもいるからねぇ。", "zh": "而且，还有{$P$}、美咲、\n小鸟姊和社长呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f03267694fd40dec4b1dc2ac3f9ca193454609f4444cf29157fdeba5f8329c31", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！　劇場にいたら\n寂しがるヒマなんかないかもしれないな。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是！\n待在剧场可能就没空觉得寂寞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "33415cd9f8347d58b383460490146c94d7abc56782117ff303e58d065b907bc8", "ja": "うん、そうだよぉ。仲間がたくさんいるから、\n毎日楽しくって、忙しいべさ。", "zh": "嗯，对呀。\n我有许多伙伴，所以每天都既快乐又忙碌哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "48b2bcaede27c768556ca0592289a77bc3417e222ee14b6dc06b143f8184b378", "ja": "ありゃ。{$P$}と\nおしゃべりしてたら、もう休憩終わりだねぇ。", "zh": "哎呀，跟{$P$}聊着聊着，\n休息时间就结束了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0143_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "fe24c3bef22c9307ae932824aced8815157d95b45f6a322a6aa112157f2e8820", "ja": "楽しいと、時間を忘れてしまったべさ。\n言ったとおりだねぇ、えへへ。", "zh": "人在开心的时候，就会不小心忘记时间哪。\n这句话说得没错呢～嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
